        {"zh": "它反手再补一拳", "en": "It follows with a backhand."},
        {"zh": "拳头带风，擦过耳朵", "en": "The fist whistles past your ear."},
        {"zh": "它把你推进月尘里", "en": "It shoves you down into the dust."},
        {"zh": "它低声嘶叫，又扑上来", "en": "It hisses low and lunges again."}
